{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","雅顿"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名睿智的法师，能够降下雷电攻击受到控制的敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","世界自有其规律"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","The world has its own rules."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","智慧如年轮，积累，成长。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Wisdom accumulates and develops just like tree rings."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","落雷！/雷电啊——"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Thunder! Lightning!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","回到自然的怀抱……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Back to nature's embrace."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","来自森林的智慧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Forrest Wisdom!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","stt"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","有什么问题吗，年轻人？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","哦，可真美啊。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","老了老了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","问题啊，需要自己解答。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","这下好了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","呵呵呵，有心了，年轻人。我十分喜欢！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哦，哦，竟然还有人记得给我礼物……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这间屋子的魔法……有趣"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","把这本书写完吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","喝点热乎乎的吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这装饰真是费心了啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我得来一大碗热汤"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这儿的装饰真有活力"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","年轻人们都很开心啊"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","雅顿信奉“不争”，对万事万物采取放任自流，不加干涉的态度，包括角上横生的草叶。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","三贤者中，雅顿身形最矮小，在魔法上造诣却最高。伊米尔则几乎没有魔法天赋。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","雅顿的胡子每三天清理一次，编辫子需要耗费小半天的时间。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","雅顿会把笔插在胡子中，以便随时取用。他也会经常忘记这一点，捋胡子时常常被藏于胡须中的笔尖戳中手指。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","雅顿从不提起自己年轻时的故事：“故事还是新的好。”"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","虽然完全看不出来，但雅顿其实有大的惊人的食量——他需要很长时间来休息和进食，才能转化积攒出庞大的魔力。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","雅顿是三贤者中最受人喜爱的一个，伊米尔过于威严，达赫妮太操心月湖村的大事小情。而雅顿看起来似乎什么都不做，于是尤其被大家喜爱。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","雅顿一直想把自己的毕生所学写成书籍，造福世人。但那将是太浩大的工程，因此至今没有启动。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","仅从外观很难判断出雅顿是清醒还是在小憩。但当你松懈下来，说出不敬的话语时，就会感受到不知从何而来的锐利目光。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","雅顿的眉毛有其专属的梳子。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","……发生了这么多事，今后丛林会走向怎样的方向呢？"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415013.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","老朋友，你一点没变……哎哟哟！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415031.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","奥曼斯 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","这间屋子的魔法……有趣"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415112.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","喝点热乎乎的吧"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415113.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","这装饰真是费心了啊"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415421.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","我得来一大碗热汤"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415422.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","这儿的装饰真有活力"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415595.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","年轻人们都很开心啊"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415596.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","雅顿"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","如今的丛林，仍然是三贤者管理吗？"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415672.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","都铎 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","雅顿贤者，你怎么知道跟着蝴蝶就能找到月影乡呢？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413060.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","最近我总会想起过去的事情……那些岁月呦，都已经变成我们这些老家伙的回忆了。"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413100.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","雅顿贤者，占卜的原理到底是什么呀？"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413140.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"]]}